    <string name="strict">Rotate not responding, force it</string>
    <string name="strict_off">Forcing each direction (on)</string>

    <string name="how">Close the phone, put your thumb on the nav bar and pull up. The deck comes with your thumb. Let go past halfway and it stays, let go short and it drops back. Tap a card to go back to that app, flick a card up to drop it. Tapping the nav bar still does back, home and recents like normal.</string>
    <string name="how_rotate">Auto rotate needs the overlay permission above, there is no way around it. It only runs while the phone is shut and the cover panel is the lit one. If turning the phone does nothing at all, hit the force button and it stops asking the system nicely and names the direction itself.</string>
