    <string name="how_shizuku">Optional, and everything works without it. With Shizuku running, the deck reads the real task list instead of guessing one, uses the pictures the system already took, and a swipe actually closes the app rather than only hiding the card. Tapping a card resumes that exact task instead of restarting the app. Shizuku stops at every reboot unless your phone is rooted, so this button will ask you to start it again.</string>
